  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6551c2dc4c741be7da5dda4d-701fac52.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with the boiling water and add a generous pinch of salt. Cook gnocchi over high-heat, until floating on the surface, 2-4 minutes.\n• Reserve pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people). Drain gnocchi and transfer to a bowl with a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6551c2dc4c741be7da5dda4d-0dc3003c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook trimmed green beans, tossing, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste, Nan's special seasoning and snacking tomatoes and cook, tossing, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, vegetable stock powder, the butter and reserved pasta water, cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat then stir through cooked gnocchi and baby spinach leaves, until wilted and combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6551c2dc4c741be7da5dda4d-e97feffd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide one-pot creamy gnocchi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6551c2dc4c741be7da5dda4d-6d818caf.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
